Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:24.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, humyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:30.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My myaster loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:43.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So if you fall in love with my myaster, I think that might bottle me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.51,0:00:49.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:53.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even I'm not gonna fall for that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:58.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus, it's just terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In this world, there are good lies and bad lies, and{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.23,0:01:04.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really are stupid, humyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.61,0:01:08.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm clever enough to lie to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.45,0:01:12.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.78,0:01:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that's not a lie...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:16.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you just mistaken?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:18.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way she could be in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.91,0:01:20.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:24.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't understand my myaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:27.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's the only my myaster I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:29.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:36.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But even though she loves you, you're going out with someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.81,0:01:40.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And showing it off in front of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.06,0:01:45.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Hanekawa isn't acting like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:51.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If anything, she wants me to be with Senjougahara! She's even given me advice{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.65,0:01:55.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what has her so stressed, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.49,0:02:03.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think a girl like my myaster could work up the guts to ask {\i1}you{\i0} out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.17,0:02:10.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She couldn't even let slip a single hint of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:22.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know everything, I{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.15,0:02:29.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, Hanekawa was{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:14.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:19.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How long has Hanekawa loved me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.89,0:04:23.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since spring break.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:29.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess my myaster thought the humyan/vyampire relationship thing was the purrfect thing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:35.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to break her free from the life she was sick of. {hi jaka if you decide you're unlazy enough to change a couple lines and rerelease my script again, this is where you make a twilight joke you can samefag-troll yourself about.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.99,0:04:38.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:44.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she never would have expected a rival to appear, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:50.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the girl you're going out with moved in lightning-fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:09.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:14.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:16.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If this is true, you've told nothing but lies, Hanekawa Tsubasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:22.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A girl raised in a cold, unloving family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:25.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,During her spring break,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:29.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she has a shocking encounter with a supernyatural entity who happens to be a classmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.83,0:05:34.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It feels like fate. Her heart begins to stir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:40.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, later, he saves her life{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}she's convinced that it's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.01,0:05:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.01,0:05:49.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether she's right or wrong, she feels like she's had something purrecious snatched away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.18,0:05:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:56.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something not quite right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:06:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I'm the source of her stress like you're saying, that wouldn't be enough to release you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:04.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There must be something else big that's stressing her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:08.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrong. It's all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:14.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But aren't you the embodiment of all the stress Hanekawa built up from her home life?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a couple months of love shouldn't{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:19.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Just"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.67,0:06:24.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And just what makes you think a few months of lovesickness
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.05,0:06:30.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,can't be worse than over a decade of family problems, meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:41.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, haven't you ever really fallen for anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.19,0:06:45.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you just dating that girl to shut her up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:52.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may as well dump her and get with my myaster, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:06:58.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't do that, cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:02.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:07.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you need to reward my myaster for everything she's done for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.09,0:07:13.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I did that, Hanekawa would just be taking advantage of my debt to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to let her do that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:24.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it. That's just a convenient excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.49,0:07:28.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't deny my feelings for Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:36.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd go for Hanekawa-san between the two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:45.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even with how she acts sometimes, I still love Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.06,0:07:58.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's the first woman I've ever really loved.{this leaves entirely too much room for memexarararagi, which is completely intentional.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:01.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.36,0:08:05.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus, cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:09.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter the circumstances, it's Hanekawa's own weakness that brought you forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:17.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What you told me is something Hanekawa should have told me herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:21.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's just forcing you to do the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:29.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of people who've lived through the same problems Hanekawa is having
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:29.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,without relying on an aberration.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:36.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her just relying on you is an insult to each one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:38.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve to say that, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:43.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I guess you've earned the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:50.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, you're the guy so kindhearted he'd even sacrifice himself to save a mortally-wounded vyampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.49,0:09:01.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're kind to everyone, that means no humyan is special.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.92,0:09:07.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand that because my myaster was kind to everyone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.09,0:09:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh well, there's no changing someone's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:17.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I learned that last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.97,0:09:20.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Learned it quite well, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.73,0:09:22.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:27.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess Hanekawa feels the same way, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:33.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I might have been a bit harsh scolding her like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:36.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:38.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:41.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vampires have a special charisma, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:46.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And because of it I've been popular with the girls since spring break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:48.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa told me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:58.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa's always so serious. If she's so caught up in her feelings, she {\i1}must{\i0}{\fscx40} {\fscx100} have been a victim of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:02.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, why did you stop talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:05.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A knockoff vyampire like you can't use his charismya at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.90,0:10:12.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:17.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The power of charismya isn't a love potion like that, anyway. {fuck the word hore. especially when used in this show.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.33,0:10:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fscx90}It's the power to completely remove their will, purroducing nothing more than your very own marionette.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.25,0:10:25.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marionette? {Teacher's pet!}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.92,0:10:26.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not just infatuate them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.34,0:10:28.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, just think, humyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:33.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are any of the girls you know what you'd call "completely obedient"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.01,0:10:38.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone who'll do anything you say, with no questions asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.77,0:10:46.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not a one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:47.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:54.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm just teasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.95,0:10:57.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That must have been{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:09.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no changing someone's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:14.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's not like my myaster at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.59,0:11:18.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I gave it away by being too dumb to lie, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:24.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's another hard part she forced you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.60,0:11:33.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I should be proud that Hanekawa loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.45,0:11:42.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we need to find Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.33,0:11:46.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that I think of it, no one I asked to help has gotten back to me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:52.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should probably tell Sengoku to call it off soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:54.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, humyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.92,0:11:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's one other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:05.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A way to confine me again without relying on a vyampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.72,0:12:06.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:12.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you walk on over to that streetlight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:17.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A little bit further, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.37,0:12:24.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right under it, so you don't have enough of a shadow there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:26.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:56.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cat, you{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.03,0:13:01.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you I didn't just come here to make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.11,0:13:07.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not pathetic enough yet to want to be friendly with a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:13.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think this will accomplish?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:15.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you I had another plan, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.05,0:13:23.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't need to be here if the source of her stress{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}you{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.15,0:13:34.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:38.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haven't you learned?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.03,0:13:42.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you attacked Hanekawa's parents during Golden Week...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.41,0:13:45.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just doing that won't solve anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:51.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't go away! You started attacking passersby!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:55.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Human stress isn't that simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:58.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I failed that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:01.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't kill her parents, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:06.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've learned. I won't make the same mistake twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:09.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will certainly kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.89,0:14:12.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kill...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:23.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's Hanekawa's inner thoughts.\NHanekawa's words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.49,0:14:28.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I owe Hanekawa my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:30.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd do anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:35.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:39.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get to ride my myaster's naughty body straight to Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.59,0:14:46.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm dying for Hanekawa's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.10,0:14:53.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.52,0:14:58.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Hanekawa kills me, Senjougahara will kill her for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.11,0:15:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I can't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the absolute worst way to handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:07.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.33,0:15:11.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.37,0:15:15.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pleading for your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.37,0:15:21.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well. If you promise you'll be my myaster's lover, I'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.80,0:15:25.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you, I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.72,0:15:27.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:31.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:34.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:45.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you could try calling for someone to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:52.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've helped plenty of people, maybe one of them will return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:55.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.17,0:16:01.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one's going to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:03.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People just accept help selfishly, for their own sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:11.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't really think that, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.43,0:16:17.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just something you say.\NIt's not how you feel, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.81,0:16:21.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The question's how you really feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:29.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe people do just accept help selfishly for their own sake{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:33.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but what does that have to do with the reasons their helper has?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:39.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many people do you think want to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you rejecting every one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.72,0:16:52.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'd be sad, wouldn't they.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa and Senjougahara...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:17:02.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru and Sengoku, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:17:02.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even Hachikuji.\NIf I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.19,0:17:06.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Save... me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:10.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Save me...\NShinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have enough of a shadow there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Stop, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:12.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you go any further, you'll kill Hanekawa too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.97,0:18:14.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:18:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:09.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't say lonely things like, "I care more about my debt to you than our friendship."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:18.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be nice, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:20.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.79,0:19:27.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, onii-chan, it's morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:29.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need to get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:31.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come {\i1}on{\i0}{\fscx40} {\fscx100}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.01,0:19:41.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, Kanbaru, who had come to check up on us, helped me and Hanekawa home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.31,0:19:53.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that day, before school, I went to the ruined cram school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.07,0:19:59.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To bring Shinobu, still hidden in my shadow, back to Oshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:01.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:18.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.76,0:20:20.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had to stop for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:22.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:24.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:27.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.73,0:20:29.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:37.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know yet how much Hanekawa remembers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need to ask her someday, but not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.33,0:20:49.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa needs time to mend her heart, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.75,0:20:56.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.92,0:20:58.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.22,0:21:03.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get to plan our next date.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.31,0:21:10.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you bring me somewhere weird, I'll flay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:13.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.32,0:21:16.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm cool with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll show you my treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:27.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someday even crabs need to start on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:33.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had Kanbaru wait for us, and after school she,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:39.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara, Hanekawa, and I went back to the ruined cram school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:54.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One day, I'll leave this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.23,0:21:59.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I understand.\NWhen I came here yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:04.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino was outside getting ready to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.66,0:22:11.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't just disappear without telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:15.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm an adult, so I at least know to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.63,0:22:18.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I realize?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.76,0:22:25.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That line itself just had to have been a farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:28.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's the kind of person who never says goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.93,0:22:35.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That awkward man who hates farewells more than anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.48,0:22:35.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It shows just how deeply he cared about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.65,0:22:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I went searching for for Shinobu, he let the meddlecat free on purpose, and left this place behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.83,0:22:59.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because he believed I could handle Shinobu and Hanekawa myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.26,0:23:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, he really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.76,0:23:09.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.18,0:23:13.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.77,0:23:16.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He sure was.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.44,0:23:20.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.86,0:23:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I may meet more aberrations in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.28,0:23:33.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's okay.\NNow I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:38.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's dark places in this world, and things that live in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.38,0:23:42.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even within my own shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.55,0:23:46.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The culture festival finally starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.97,0:23:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our class project is{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.43,0:23:52.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a haunted house.
